Package: php-duckdb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${php:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: DuckDB in-process analytical database bindings for PHP
 DuckDB is an in-process SQL OLAP database management system. This
 extension provides PHP bindings for the DuckDB C API: connections,
 prepared statements, result sets, and appender support.
 .
 The extension links against the system DuckDB library (libduckdb).
